{
    "_doc": "Public riverside park along the embankment. Minimal standalone faction: the world faction (Manageable_World) cannot own it - its only room is the world-map transit room, so a booking there would lead to that room, and world-map travel time is only measured between initializeFactions members with their own door. No floor plan: rooms are hideOnMap with no offsetX/offsetY, walking minutes as door cost (hospital pattern). No members and no staff.",
    "_doc_recreation": "Anyone may stroll or jog here (generic recreation, ungated) on the promenade or lawn. Ordinary 30-minute rounds allow the existing random multiroom dispatch to reselect a surface. Fireworks viewing retains its active-offer gate. Stroll and jogging are Flexible offers; fireworks remain seasonal. No MemberTypes: a booked visit runs on its offer's own workModule.",

